    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Here begins a new tale \u2014</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will you choose your own words, or those of others? \u2014</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIn the world of a picture book you wandered into, there was a prince who looked just like you...\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839510/extras/52004c55a513e4de9ff6b2d1d82b0076.avif?t=1755397947\" width=616 height=375 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Perfect Prince</strong> is an adventure game featuring a touching story and storybook-style visuals. Progress through puzzles and light action, as the tale branches based on your choices and actions. Build bonds with the characters and shape a story that\u2019s uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839510/extras/171b0b2c1a99504a0dd28b4fe2ca7e55.avif?t=1755397947\" width=614 height=495 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roking\uff01</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROCOCO GAMES</strong>' first indie title!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the philosophy of creating games that move the heart, we continue to develop with passion every day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839510/extras/e4aed6f005740b16a2090d94600326ed.poster.webp?t=1755397947\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839510/extras/e4aed6f005740b16a2090d94600326ed.webp?t=1755397947\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=128 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Here begins a new tale \u2014</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will you choose your own words, or those of others? \u2014</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIn the world of a picture book you wandered into, there was a prince who looked just like you...\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839510/extras/52004c55a513e4de9ff6b2d1d82b0076.avif?t=1755397947\" width=616 height=375 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Perfect Prince</strong> is an adventure game featuring a touching story and storybook-style visuals. Progress through puzzles and light action, as the tale branches based on your choices and actions. Build bonds with the characters and shape a story that\u2019s uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839510/extras/171b0b2c1a99504a0dd28b4fe2ca7e55.avif?t=1755397947\" width=614 height=495 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roking\uff01</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROCOCO GAMES</strong>' first indie title!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the philosophy of creating games that move the heart, we continue to develop with passion every day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839510/extras/e4aed6f005740b16a2090d94600326ed.poster.webp?t=1755397947\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839510/extras/e4aed6f005740b16a2090d94600326ed.webp?t=1755397947\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=128 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
